lasses-free 3D effects visible within a 120-degree viewing cone.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this display be installed on outdoor building corners?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it has an IP65 rating making it fully weatherproof and suitable for outdoor installation on building corners, shopping malls, and landmarks.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of content is compatible with this 3D LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display supports real-time 3D rendering content specifically designed for its lenticular and parallax barrier system to maximize the glasses-free viewing experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the refresh rate affect the display performance?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a refresh rate of 7,680Hz, the display ensures smooth, flicker-free visuals, improving image quality and viewer comfort.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx provide?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty covering manufacturing defects and technical support to ensure reliable long-term operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does NakedEye 3D Corner compare to traditional 3D displays that require glasses?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional 3D displays, NakedEye 3D Corner delivers immersive 3D effects without the need for glasses, increasing viewer engagement and reducing operational complexity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are typical applications or venues for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It's ideally suited for building corners, shopping malls, and iconic landmarks to create captivating, immersive 3D advertising and visual experiences.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"